// MTV Remote Play -- Helios GPC 3 compatibility slot
// ===================================================
//
// RemotePlay output is intentionally NOT implemented in this file.
// MTVRemotePlay.py owns the complete controller path:
//
//   physical DS5/XInput -> Python bridge -> ViGEm virtual pad -> Remote Play
//
// The Python bridge also owns shot charging, the CV-triggered release, dunk
// handling, release direction, timing, and the neutral return. Repeating that
// logic in Helios GPC 3 creates two independent release engines and can cause
// duplicate flicks, changing timing, or missed shots.
//
// Keep this script minimal. It exists so Helios can populate and start a GPC 3
// slot when a layout expects one. Input passes through unchanged; all MTV
// behavior remains in the single authoritative Python/ViGEm path.

main {
}
